@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5303

GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Summarize a document
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/summary
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a sample document about GadgetsInc products and services.
--boundary--

###

### Check a document for PII/GDPR compliance
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/compliance
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Customer: John Doe, email: john.doe@example.com, phone: +44 7911 123456
--boundary--

###